{
  "name": "@angular-community/qwik-material-examples",
  "version": "0.0.0",
  "description": "Shared docs-example modules for qwik-material: one reusable component per material.angular.dev headline example, imported by both src/qwik-cdk-dev-app (parity routes) and src/qwik-material-docs (the docs site's live Examples tab). No build step — consumed directly from TypeScript source by both apps' Qwik/Vite pipelines, same as qwik-cdk/qwik-material are consumed via the `qwik` export condition.",
